policy is {"registry": "registry.example.test/", "exempt_namespaces": ["kube-system"]}

Rules, applied to every container unless the namespace is exempt:
  1. image must start with policy["registry"]                     -> reason "registry"
  2. securityContext.privileged must not be true                  -> reason "privileged"
  3. securityContext.runAsNonRoot must be true                    -> reason "root"
  4. securityContext.allowPrivilegeEscalation must be false       -> reason "escalation"
  5. the pod must not use hostNetwork                             -> reason "hostnetwork" (once per pod)
  6. pod["signed"] must be true                                   -> reason "unsigned" (once per pod)
Return (True, []) when nothing is violated, else (False, reasons) with each reason once, in the order above.
"""

def admit(pod, policy):
